				<r3d:description language="eng">The Polish Polar Data Base is an open data repository of Polish Polar Consortium (PKPol) basing on CENAGIS Platform. The portal is used to collect and share research data and metadata from external repositories and centers in a standardised way with geoportal functionality. The database POLAR-PL is one of the results of The HarSval Norwegian-Polish Project (2025) harmonised with SIOS Data Access Portal. The repository serves datasets with reach metadata according with FAIR principles. The database provides tools for integration basic geomorfological, glaciological, oceanographic, meteorogical data with other thematic data services (as international GNSS services, EUPOS etc.) and for data geovisualisation and basic tools and applications for data analysis, including the use of big data.</r3d:description>
